{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1425 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "57ad3f6342b022e2a8b6c3e7294759b299e4799f22057a30c31485f6bd59cf80" :edb/db-before-t 1424 :edb/db-after-t 1425 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534737 50 #inst "2026-10-12T09:58:41.647Z" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186192781 1038 #edb/ref 17592186434595 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186342187 1071 "Which of the following sets is a subspace of ${R}^{3}?$\n\n- $A={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:1-x-y=0}$\n- $B={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}\\le 1}$\n- $C={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:2x+3y-z=0}$" 13194139534737 17592186045417 false] [17592186342187 1071 "Which of the following sets is a subspace of ${R}^{3}?$\n\nI. $A=\\{⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:1-x-y=0\\}$\n\nII. $B=\\{⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}\\le 1\\}$\n\nIII. $C=\\{⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:2x+3y-z=0\\}$" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1043 #edb/ref 17592186434596 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1043 #edb/ref 17592186434597 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1043 #edb/ref 17592186434598 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1043 #edb/ref 17592186434599 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1043 #edb/ref 17592186434600 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1045 "Subspaces of N-Dimensional Space: Geometric Interpretation" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1046 #edb/ref 17592186434597 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048337 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434588 1053 #uuid "888de114-5cc0-5506-ab02-2950778f2cdd" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434589 1080 "I and II only" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434589 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434589 1083 #uuid "1382095a-ce36-5649-9176-e51b8a45eecf" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434590 1080 "I and III only" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434590 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434590 1083 #uuid "1b5c0bb0-6a86-5a6c-bcaf-1f0fea305db4" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434591 1080 "II and III only" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434591 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434591 1083 #uuid "d03236d8-6be8-5408-b90d-1fcabe487cf1" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434592 1080 "II only" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434592 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434592 1083 #uuid "e18c382f-1d1e-5fc7-a402-581360ddc5de" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434593 1080 "I only" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434593 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434593 1083 #uuid "e3d0d900-1221-5e04-8384-9a017c7b2878" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434589 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434590 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434591 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434592 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434593 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1077 "selection" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1078 #edb/ref 17592186434589 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434594 1079 #uuid "b99629cf-233b-5877-9205-658da974228d" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434594 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1069 "q-35575" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1071 "Which of the following sets is a subspace of ${R}^{2}?$\n\nI. $A=\\{⟨x,y⟩\\in {R}^{2}:y=0\\}$\n\nII. $B=\\{⟨x,y⟩\\in {R}^{2}:y=3x\\}$\n\nIII. $C=\\{⟨x,y⟩\\in {R}^{2}:y=2\\}$" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1072 #uuid "8f1ed82d-67ec-55b7-826d-30733bc2c88f" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434595 1074 "Let's analyze each of the subsets.\n\n- The set $A$ is a subspace. It represents a line, and a line is a subspace if and only if it passes through the origin. Here, the components of the zero vector $0=⟨0,0⟩$ satisfy the equation $y=0$ since $0=0.$ So, $0$ lies in $A.$\n\n- The set $B$ is a subspace. It represents a line, and a line is a subspace if and only if it passes through the origin. Here, the components of the zero vector $0=⟨0,0⟩$ satisfy the equation $y=3x$ since $0=3\\cdot 0.$ So, $0$ lies in $B.$\n\n- The set $C$ is not a subspace because it does not contain the zero vector. Indeed, $0=⟨0,0⟩$ does not satisfy the condition $y=2$ since $0\\ne 2.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434596 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434600 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434596 1062 #uuid "353deabb-99c1-527a-9354-09b539a6e8de" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434596 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434595 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434597 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434596 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434597 1062 #uuid "63f6444a-ffbe-508f-8985-460e2401c922" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434597 1063 #edb/ref 17592186317349 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434598 1062 #uuid "769529b7-074a-511d-8739-3df09643b9d7" 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434598 1063 #edb/ref 17592186275442 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434599 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434598 13194139534737 17592186045417 true] [17592186434599 1062 #